OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who sexually abused boy is
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who sexually abused a boy she
OL,7,Ftutored has been jailed for seven
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FDeborah Franklin, 65, who taught at a
OL,11,Fpreparatory school in Hertfordshire,
OL,12,Fwas the complainant's private tutor
OL,13,Fduring the 1990s and had subjected him
OL,14,Fto "repeated sexual activity" while he
OL,15,Fwas aged between nine and 12.
OL,17,FIn July, she was convicted of eight
OL,18,Fcounts of gross indecency against the
OL,19,Fboy after a trial.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
